  "description": "After three regressions spent as a sacrifice for the “true child of destiny,” LeBlain decides that her fourth life will be different: she will escape. To fund her exile, she chooses adoption—only to be taken in by a notorious villain family. What begins as a desperate survival plan slowly transforms into something far more unexpected: a child who tames villains with kindness, resolve, and an unshakable heart. A healing romance fantasy about growth, redemption, and finding love in the most unlikely place.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
